oot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magic Plate Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Plate_Armor_0b603a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sweet%20Smelling%20Bait\"><img alt=\"Sweet Smelling Bait\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sweet_Smelling_Bait_75e43e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mastermind Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mastermind_Shield_571249.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Demon Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Trophy_7bbde8.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demonrage Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonrage_Sword_d0c629.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General_Info\">General Info</span></h2>\n<p>Demon Hell is an area deep in the Edron <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>, with 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a> spawns, plus another 4 in the quest area of DHQ. This area also leads to the <a href=\"#/quest/demon-helmet-quest\">Demon Helmet Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_enter\">How to enter</span></h2>\n<ul><li>First of all you need level 100 to pass the level door.</li>\n<li>Then you need <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%206010\">Key 6010</a> that you can get in <a href=\"#/quest/parchment-room-quest\">Parchment Room Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>Finally you will need help from two players that will stand on nearby switches for a wall to open.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"a45f6bc2bd775ea923f67a804a22a3ab\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:186px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Demonhell_switches-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:16.5px;\"><img alt=\"The two switches you need to have people standing on to open the wall.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The two switches you need to have people standing on to open the wall.\" height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonhell_switches_2f0772.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Demonhell switches.jpg (74 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The two switches you need to have people standing on to open the wall.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:186px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Demonhell_lvl_door-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The level door. You can see the locked door at the top.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The level door. You can see the locked door at the top.\" height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonhell_lvl_door_790dae.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Demonhell lvl door.jpg (74 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The level door. You can see the locked door at the top.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:186px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Demonhell_wall-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:167px; width:185px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"The wall that opens when two people stand on the switches. You can see the locked door at the bottom.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The wall that opens when two people stand on the switches. You can see the locked door at the bottom.\" height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonhell_wall_b0b024.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Demonhell wall.jpg (75 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The wall that opens when two people stand on the switches. You can see the locked door at the bottom.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Inside\">Inside</span></h2>\n<p>Once you passed the wall, go north, then east facing several <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>. Now you will see a ladder down, to a pit which contains approximately 15 Fire Elementals. You will face at least 6-7 at the start, which makes it hard to get in. Once you get through, there will be stairs up, another few Fire Elementals, a few ropeholes/ramps, and then in the end you will be at a teleporter. This teleporter will take you down one level, to the first (single) demon spawn. The teleporter in this room takes you back to the first teleporter. The hole in the east will NOT take you down one level to the pit with 5 demons you can see (however you can jump there using levitate spell), but right under it is another hole so you fall down 2 levels to the main part of Demon Hell.\nA bit to the left are stairs up. If you take another stairs up, you will go to the single demon spawn again, with no way of going back down the same stairs.\nIf you go down, and all the way to the east, you will see the teleporter that takes you into the quest room of the DHQ.\n</p><p><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demonhell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"201\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonhell_280480.jpg\" width=\"620\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Demon Hell Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Fire Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Elemental_52695e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">220</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">180 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\"><img alt=\"Demon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_e0b935.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1530 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">500 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">250 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">300 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">480 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>) + <span style=\"white-space: nowr